<com:TContent ID="body">

<h1>TActiveClientScript Sample</h1>

<p>The script block on this page is hidden, so it does not run when the page first loads.
The button sends it in a callback response.</p>

<table class="sampletable">

<tr><td class="samplenote">
Send the script block in a callback response:
</td><td class="sampleaction">
<com:TActiveButton ID="Button1" Text="Send the script" OnCallback="sendScript" />
</td></tr>

<tr><td class="samplenote">
Times the script block has run:
</td><td class="sampleaction">
<span id="activecount">0</span>
</td></tr>

<tr><td class="samplenote">
Call the function that the script block declares. The button runs on the client and sends
no request:
</td><td class="sampleaction">
<input type="button" value="Call the function" onclick="document.getElementById('fnresult').innerHTML = (typeof window.quickstartGreeting === 'function') ? window.quickstartGreeting() : 'The function is not declared yet.';" />
<span id="fnresult">The function is not declared yet.</span>
</td></tr>

</table>

<com:TActiveClientScript ID="Script1" Visible="false">
	window.quickstartGreeting = function () {
		return 'The script block declared this function.';
	};
	(function () {
		var el = document.getElementById('activecount');
		el.innerHTML = parseInt(el.innerHTML, 10) + 1;
	})();
</com:TActiveClientScript>

</com:TContent>
